; What `build_site.exe --out DIR` is allowed to delete.  Needs no GPU, no
; libwgpu_native and no odoc output (the site is built with --no-api).
;
; The deps are the files the site generator reads plus every repository file
; its link checker resolves; --root points at the build context copy of them.
; The list must be complete: run this with `dune build @runtest --sandbox copy`
; to catch a dep that only works because the build directory happens to have
; the file.

